    "heading": "FALLING AND COLLISION DAMAGE",
    "lineStart": 4865,
    "lineEnd": 4873,
    "pdfPageStart": 92,
    "pdfPageEnd": 92
  },
  "rulesText": "If a character falls to the ground, you can use the following as a guide to determine the damage they take:\n\n- A fall from Very Close range deals 1d10+3 physical damage.\n- A fall from Close range deals 1d20+5 physical damage.\n- A fall from Far or Very Far range deals 1d100+15 physical damage, or death at the GM’s discretion.\n\nIf a character collides with an object or another character at a dangerous speed, they take 1d20+5 direct physical damage.",
  "htmlPage": {
